    {"id":6,"type":"TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5","title":"3 · Full song style and ALL lyrics","pos":[370,0],"size":[620,700],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":2},{"name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":6},{"name":"duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"duration"},"link":4}],"outputs":[{"name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[8,9],"slot_index":0}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5"},"widgets_values":["A cheerful English classroom action song for young learners. Simple memorable melody, steady 100 BPM in 4/4, C major, bright acoustic pop, ukulele, piano, light hand claps. One clear lead singer, natural English pronunciation, moderate singing speed, every word intelligible, short phrases with breathing gaps. Short instrumental intro and a clean ending. Sing the provided lyrics in order. Minimal vocal harmonies, no spoken introduction, no ad libs, no rap, no extra words. Balanced clean production, vocals prominent.","[Verse]\nClap your hands, feel so happy!\nStomp your feet, feel so happy!\nSpin around, feel so happy!\nWave hello, feel so happy!\n\n[Chorus]\nHappy, happy, that is me!\nHappy, happy, you and me!\n\n[Verse]\nSmile so big, feel so happy!\nJump up high, feel so happy!\nSnap your fingers, feel so happy!\nShout out yes, feel so happy!\n\n[Chorus]\nHappy, happy, that is me!\nHappy, happy, you and me!\n\n[Outro]\nClap again, feel so happy!\nWave goodbye, feel so happy!\nHappy, happy, that is me!\nHappy, happy, you and me!",20260912,"fixed",100,60,"4","en","C major",true,2,0.85,0.9,0,0]},
