    {"id":13,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"Scope and synchronization","pos":[1040,410],"size":[690,255],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## What this workflow does\nGenerates ONE complete mixed song from ALL supplied lyrics. It does not concatenate separately generated lines.\n\n## What it does NOT do\nNo automatic instrumental stem or verified lyric timestamps are produced here. Run source separation and lyric alignment after generation. See docs/ComfyUI-整曲生成与毫秒歌词对齐.md.\n\n## Important\nDuration is shared by the encoder and latent node. A random shared seed gives a new song each run. Section tags belong only to the generation input, not displayed classroom lyrics. Do not put guessed timestamps in the lyrics input.\n\n## Models\nUse the four split model files from the official ComfyUI ACE-Step 1.5 guide. Select the installed paths if your files are in subfolders. SaveAudio is a legacy core FLAC node; if unavailable, replace it with Save Audio (Advanced), format=flac."]}
